[25.904938, "o", "ation:\u001b[36X\u001b[16;72H\u001b[1K\r\n  1. \u001b[1mConsistent results under mutation\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m\u001b[48;2;40;42;54m — since cursors reference a      \r\n     specific record position rather than an offset, inserts/deletes    \r\n     elsewhere in the dataset don't cause skipped or duplicated items   \r\n     across pages.\u001b[54X\r\n  2. \u001b[1mBetter performance at scale\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m\u001b[48;2;40;42;54m — cursors avoid the \u001b[38;5;153mOFFSET\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m scan cost of\r\n     skipping N rows, giving consistent query speed even deep into      \r\n     large datasets.\u001b[52X\u001b[24;72H\u001b[1K\u001b[38;5;246m\r\n✻\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m \u001b[38;5;246mCrunched for 2s · done 4:34 PM\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m\u001b[40X\u001b[26;72H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\r\n \u001b[54X\u001b[38;5;246m\u001b[54C○ low · /effort\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  \u001b[38;5;244m\r\n──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────"]
